WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.390
OP sequence

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:10.740
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.690
You said it with so much confidence back then...

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.740
You have never made pudding before!

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:16.780
closed captions

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:17.160
B-But I was frustrated that Koshiro-san had spoken so badly about Henri-sensei.

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:21.650
Even then, if you lose this pudding confrontation...

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:26.040
Let the both of us make sweet sweets together!

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:34.710
To team up with Ojou again... No way!

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:38.220
I get it. But what should I do?

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:43.410
Ichigo, you just have to practice since it's come to this.

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:50.980
Thankfully, there are supplies of all the ingredients you would need.

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:55.490
Let's work like horses as long as time permits.

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:59.660
Don't get the wrong idea! I'm only doing this for Kashino.

00:01:00.230 --> 00:01:01.560
You guys...

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:04.170
Do you really think that I can do it too?

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:12.080
Certainly, pudding is a simple sweet, made with basic ingredients of sugar, eggs and milk.

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:16.840
That's right. With practice, you should be able to make it.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:19.860
With practice?

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:27.550
That's right. So far I've managed to improve little by little by practicing.

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:30.020
This time will be no different!

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:31.640
I get it!

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:34.530
I'll practice intensively in the two days before the confrontation.

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:37.130
I'll show you that I can master making pudding!

