00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:15.240
Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:23.360
I should start with the caramel sauce?

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:24.270
Oui!

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:25.320
Caramel sauce is...

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:28.310
Melting sugar in water! It's a simple sauce.

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:31.020
You can leave the caramel to me.

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.930
Sure! Thanks, Caramel.

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:37.020
Vanilla's supposed to be your partner, Ichigo!

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:41.030
I'm sorry. You can teach me to make the dough, Vanilla.

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:43.700
Well, I start off with sugar, right?

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:44.530
That's right!

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:48.700
First, add sugar and water in a pot together.

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:50.600
That's it!

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:53.740
Now wait until it becomes a pretty amber colour.

00:03:56.260 --> 00:03:59.100
Umm, is this about right?

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:01.730
Yes, this is fine.

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:05.750
Turn off the burner and to finish it off, add a tablespoon of water.

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:07.840
Huh? A tablespoon?

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:09.270
Um...

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:10.450
Huh?

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:12.260
Where is it? Where is it?

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:14.270
Ah, hurry up!

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:16.010
It's going to burn!

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:19.060
Ichigo, here!

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:20.880
Ah, t-thanks!

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:30.480
recipe 9

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:30.480
The Pudding Confrontation of Fate!!

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:33.700
Be careful of splatters!

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:37.110
Jeez... Tell me that sooner...

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.100
Forget it! Just hurry.

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:41.210
Caramel sauce solidifies quickly.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:44.170
Pour it into cups while it's still hot.

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:45.890
Right!

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:51.520
What part of this is simple?

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:57.090
There's no time for rest, Ichigo. It's the pudding batter next.

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:01.310
The pudding batter is made by mixing sugar, eggs and milk.

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:03.710
You then bake it in the oven.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:05.320
No, no!

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:10.550
To prevent the egg from frothing, beat in circular strokes.

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:14.660
There must be no pores for it to be pretty and delicious.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:15.710
What's a pore?

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:21.150
They are small air bubbles that form in the pudding due to high temperature.

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:23.970
Its flavour could be ruined by this.

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:27.460
I see. Got it.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:34.940
Oui! All that's left is to fill the pan with hot water, and bake in the oven!

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:35.640
Uh, yeah!

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:40.820
For the pudding to be smooth, it's best to keep the water between 60 to 70°C.

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:46.550
Therefore boiling water's not good, right?

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:49.290
Were you even listening to me?

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:51.270
Vanilla's scary.

00:05:51.270 --> 00:05:53.280
She's always been a slave driver.

00:05:56.260 --> 00:05:57.510
Smells good!

00:05:57.510 --> 00:06:01.940
Now that it's baked, when the cooking heat's gone, place it in the refrigerator for an hour.

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:02.460
Okay!

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:08.690
They should be ready now, right?

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:11.340
Done!

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:14.350
Well, it looks alright.

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:16.380
It's a nice baked colour.

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:18.550
It's now a matter of taste.

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:20.810
Yeah, I wonder...

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:22.570
Hurry and try some, guys.

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:26.230
Well then, Itadakimasu!

00:06:32.110 --> 00:06:33.780
Bitter!

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:37.200
No way!

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.010
It's so bitter!

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:43.710
You boiled the caramel for too long.

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:47.210
You have to ascertain it's amber coloured.

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:48.910
What's ascertain?

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:51.940
A pale amber sauce will be too sweet.

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:55.520
On the other hand, if it's too dark, then it becomes too bitter like this.

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:59.930
A nice amber-coloured sauce will be just sweet with a tinge of bitterness.

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:02.650
So that's how it is.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:06.200
Also, as I feared, there are pores.

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:08.350
The oven was probably too hot?

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:11.320
Yeah... And the texture is stiff.

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:15.030
It's a complete failure...

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:17.470
There's no need to worry, Ichigo-chan.

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:19.750
Everyone will make mistakes on their first try.

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.040
We were no different.

00:07:21.720 --> 00:07:23.550
Hanabusa-kun...

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:26.260
The taste varies with your combination of the ingredients.

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:30.880
Don't rush. Just find the way that works best for you.

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:35.230
By adding more egg yolk and decreasing the baking temperature, you'll get a smoother texture.

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:39.150
Well, there are many different methods available.

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:46.600
I see. While it's simple to make, there's really a lot more to pudding.

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:49.110
Somehow, it's really interesting!

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:51.180
I'll try much harder!

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:53.770
I'll master pudding before the night ends!

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:56.700
Oui! That's the way, Ichigo!

00:07:57.400 --> 00:07:59.320
We start with the caramel sauce, right?

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:00.540
Oui!

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:02.400
In just one night?

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:03.880
She's underestimating pudding.

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:09.370
Well, that may be true, but if she loses we'll be teaming up with Ojou again.

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:14.490
Anyway, you must give it your best shot, Amano!

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:20.960
Oh my?

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:22.600
I see.

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:26.110
It seems like she's having intensive training on making pudding.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:29.620
She must be like a novice at this!

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:32.500
That means our victory is ensured.

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:39.420
After all, Ojou-sama's pudding is made from Silkie eggs, Wasanbon sugar, and Jersey milk!

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:41.620
Using only the finest of ingredients!

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:45.510
Moreover, we've installed the same oven as the ones in senior high school!

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:48.800
Ojou-sama who's familiar with this will never be disqualified.

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:51.580
Excellent work, Satou, Shiotani!

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:53.830
Not at all. For the sake of Ojou-sama..

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:56.040
This is nothing much!

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:57.470
Sweet Satou!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.800
And bitter Shiotani!

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:02.850
We are your devoted servants, Miya Ojou-sama!

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:11.910
I'll show you clearly that it is I who should team up with Makoto-kun for the Grand Prix!

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:14.900
Amano Ichigo!

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:16.970
But Ojou-sama...

00:09:16.970 --> 00:09:18.280
What is it?

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:20.130
Why go to such lengths for Kashino?

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:24.230
I don't see how that has to do with the both of you.

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:26.490
I've left the cleaning up to you.

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:34.420
Makoto-kun...

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:39.930
A year ago when we first met at the first year's welcoming party...

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:42.380
Disgusting.

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:45.060
W-What did you say!?

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:48.390
Did you just say that my, Koshiro Miya's pudding is disgusting!?

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:53.400
It's full of pores, and the caramel wasn't boiled enough so it's too sweet.

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:56.820
I'm surprised you were accepted to this school with such skills.

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:06.000
As the daughter of Château confectionery, everyone just compliments

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.620
without telling me how it really tasted.

00:10:09.390 --> 00:10:15.700
But this past year, I studied under top-class pâtissiers and honed my skills.

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:18.810
Makoto-kun...

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:21.410
I'm different from what I was back then.

00:10:22.210 --> 00:10:23.270
This time...

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:38.080
H-Hey, Amano!

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:42.840
Good morning, Kashino...

00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:45.030
Good morning...

00:10:45.030 --> 00:10:47.210
Huh? What's the matter, everyone?

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:49.870
We were worried, so we came to check on you.

00:10:50.490 --> 00:10:53.430
You made all these in one night?

00:10:53.430 --> 00:10:54.840
Huh? Yeah...

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:58.540
To confirm the baking conditions for caramel pudding,

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:02.330
I ended up using all the pots and ovens in the entire cooking classroom.

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:05.760
We've got to clean up before class starts.

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:09.470
But thanks to that, I've got it down pat.

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:11.260
Well, try some!

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:14.610
She's gotten burnt so much...

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:18.050
This is delicious.

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:21.910
I'm surprised you could become this good in just one night.

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:22.900
Yeah.

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:26.230
The caramel sauce is just right.

00:11:26.230 --> 00:11:28.480
There should be a limit to the amount she made.

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:29.660
What's that supposed to mean, Chocolat?

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:32.480
But sometimes they have pores...

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:34.550
Even though I make them the same way.

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:38.240
Were those ones baked in the oven below?

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:39.170
Huh? Yeah...

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:42.980
That oven's hotter than the others.

00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:45.180
It's easier to use the one above.

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:46.320
Is that so?

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:49.440
Each oven has its own quirks.

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:51.390
To use them, you need to know the quirks.

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:54.010
Quirks, huh?

00:11:54.010 --> 00:11:56.570
There's still so much I don't know.

00:11:57.120 --> 00:12:00.120
Ah... it's really delicious.

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:01.960
What's this? It's too sweet.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:05.580
I didn't cook the caramel enough on that. It's sweet, right?

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:09.370
Actually, I like it sweet better!

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:10.920
Ah! I see!

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:14.110
Ichigo-chan, are you going to have intensive training again tonight?

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:15.910
If so, I'll bring some refreshments.

00:12:16.350 --> 00:12:20.170
Thanks! But I have plans tonight, so I'm okay.

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:25.820
It is time.

00:12:25.820 --> 00:12:30.600
We will now begin the match between Koshiro Miya and Amano Ichigo.

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:36.280
Please make five servings of custard pudding within two hours.

00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:37.900
The Chairman will be the judge.

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:41.610
I'm looking forward to delicious pudding.

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:44.330
I can't lose...

00:12:46.230 --> 00:12:49.700
I'll show you the difference in our determination.

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:54.330
Begin.

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:02.770
My heart's beating so fast, Ma-chan.

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:04.860
How does your nervousness help?

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:08.300
Ichigo-chan looks pale.

00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:11.260
Even though she didn't practice last night...

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:15.200
Ojou completed the caramel without a hitch.

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:18.150
You can tell even at a distance that the sweetness is just right.

00:13:19.010 --> 00:13:20.410
And the viscosity is ideal.

00:13:21.090 --> 00:13:21.890
What about Amano-san?

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:26.610
Idiot! She's boiling it too much!

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:27.910
If she doesn't turn off the heat quickly...

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:34.750
Oww!

00:13:36.780 --> 00:13:37.890
She's done it now...

00:13:37.890 --> 00:13:39.160
It'll be too bitter like that!

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:42.920
My, my, she didn't get it after all.

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:47.260
It's Ichigo we're talking about! She definitely has something planned.

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:48.890
Oh my...

00:13:55.810 --> 00:14:00.630
Even though they look the same, but the ovens here are different from those in middle school.

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:02.900
Be perplexed when it's done.

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:05.400
Okay!

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:08.330
This battle is mine.

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:10.320
Done.

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:12.470
Mine, too.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:15.490
Both of you have finished.

00:14:16.970 --> 00:14:19.920
They both look so delicious!

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:23.460
I will start off with Koshiro-san's.

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:25.660
Koshiro-san's pudding...

00:14:26.480 --> 00:14:31.680
What amazingly deep colours! No matter what eggs I used, mine never looked like that...

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:36.660
Well, this is something.

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:39.700
You used silkie eggs, right?

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:43.200
And the milk is Jersey milk.

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:45.620
Silkie?

00:14:46.520 --> 00:14:48.710
And Amano-san's next...

00:14:52.460 --> 00:14:53.670
Please!

00:14:57.220 --> 00:14:58.260
How is it?

00:14:58.260 --> 00:14:59.110
Ichigo...

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:04.840
T-This is...

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:09.510
Did I fail?

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:12.180
I knew it would be too bitter!

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:13.810
Shut up, Andou!

00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:14.570
Be quiet.

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:16.670
He's made his decision.

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:23.730
Mastering it in two days was impossible after all.

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:26.730
I will now announce the results.

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:32.260
The winner of the pudding confrontation is...

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:36.240
Second year, from the A-group, Amano Ichigo.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:41.260
All right!

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:42.580
Ichigo-chan!

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:44.400
You've won!

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:46.750
What? I really won?

00:15:47.110 --> 00:15:49.120
Banzai, Ichigo!

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:48.520
Bravo!

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:50.760
A great victory!

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:56.130
W-Why? You complimented my pudding and all.

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:57.630
Yes.

00:15:58.270 --> 00:16:01.800
It was rich and delicious.

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:07.770
No way, there are pores.

00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:10.580
And this is Amano-san's.

00:16:10.580 --> 00:16:13.020
I-It's impossible!

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:16.930
I practiced on an oven of the same model.

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:18.990
And I didn't fail even once!

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:23.240
Being the same model doesn't make it the same.

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:28.070
The oven you used bakes strongly.

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:31.170
If you don't compensate for that, it becomes too stiff.

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:35.630
H-How would I know something like that!?

00:16:35.630 --> 00:16:38.140
Amano-san knew.

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:42.640
Her after classes ended for the high schoolers last night,

00:16:44.110 --> 00:16:49.150
and had asked to practice here so she could learn the oven's quirks.

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:52.160
She then practiced until dawn.

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:54.010
So that's why you're...

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:56.210
Those were the plans you mentioned yesterday...

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:57.870
Yeah...

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:00.580
But what about the taste?

00:17:01.010 --> 00:17:04.560
Amano Ichigo's caramel sauce should be too bitter!

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:07.630
I actually did that on purpose.

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:08.680
What did you say?

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:12.800
The Chairman was eating a Gâteau chocolate the other day.

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:15.210
That must have been quite bitter.

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:16.780
And he drank his coffee black.

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:21.670
I thought he must prefer things bitter, so I boiled my caramel down almost completely.

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:26.290
It really is to my taste.

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:29.190
It's impressive you've thought that far.

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:31.190
That's unfair.

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:33.640
To actually find out the Chairman's preference!

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:37.200
No, that's not true.

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:40.640
Amano-san just knew,

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:43.810
about the oven's quirks and my preferences.

00:17:43.810 --> 00:17:51.920
They might seem trivial, but they're important to those attempting to please the people they serve.

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:58.090
It's the most important thing for those aiming to be a pâtissière.

00:17:58.090 --> 00:17:59.930
Chairman-sensei!

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:03.150
Amazing, Amano-san! I've changed my opinion of you.

00:18:03.150 --> 00:18:05.150
You did well to notice all that!

00:18:05.530 --> 00:18:08.650
No, it's all thanks to the things you've taught me.

00:18:09.070 --> 00:18:10.800
Thank you so much!

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:16.190
Well, you've probably improved a little.

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:17.030
Yeah!

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:20.800
Don't get too arrogant, Amano Ichigo.

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:22.690
This was just a fluke!

00:18:23.530 --> 00:18:28.210
I'll definitely make you regret this by beating you in the Grand Prix!

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:31.750
Ojou-sama!

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:33.340
Please wait!

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:36.640
Let's take this chance to...

00:18:48.550 --> 00:18:51.430
Everything's fine now that you don't have to team up with Koshiro-san, right?

00:18:51.920 --> 00:18:54.690
But somehow, she's pretty scary.

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:59.610
You may have made an enemy of Château confectionery.

00:19:00.310 --> 00:19:01.750
President Tennouji!

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:05.320
U-Umm, thanks for everything!

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:09.260
But, I know you will all be fine.

00:19:10.110 --> 00:19:13.820
Because the four of you have a Sweets Spirits with you.

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:19.550
I'm looking forward to the cakes you'll show me.

00:19:23.440 --> 00:19:25.060
A Sweets Spirit!

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:28.150
Let us meet again at the Grand Prix.

00:19:29.170 --> 00:19:31.060
The President also has a Sweets Spirit!

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:33.580
That was Honey-sama...

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:36.150
It's really, truly amazing!

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:38.890
Ichigo-chan, you don't have to be that surprised...

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:42.140
But she said "Let us meet at the Grand Prix."

00:19:42.140 --> 00:19:45.760
That means the president acknowledges my skills, right?

00:19:46.190 --> 00:19:47.040
Amano-san...

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:47.740
What, what?

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:53.460
While it's still fresh in your mind, you should review the basics of making pudding, shouldn't you?

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:58.320
That's right. Not just a pudding that suits the Chairman's preferences.

00:19:58.320 --> 00:20:01.970
You must be able to make pudding that anyone could enjoy.

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:05.480
Not a problem! I can even do that now!

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:08.730
After all, I'm a respectable member of the A-group too!

00:20:09.150 --> 00:20:12.020
I'm entering the Grand Prix with all of you!

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:14.960
And we'll definitely win!

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:19.150
It's unfortunate, but as you are now, we won't make it past the first round.

00:20:20.730 --> 00:20:23.200
The world of the Grand Prix is harsh.

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:26.450
You're greatly mistaken if you think you can win with just efforts alone.

00:20:26.840 --> 00:20:27.990
No way...

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:31.750
You've got such little improvements way over your head.

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:37.960
Why...

00:20:38.520 --> 00:20:42.430
I thought I have finally proved myself...

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:46.140
Why won't they acknowledge me?

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:51.230
Ichigo, they're only being strict for your own good.

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:52.980
But...

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:55.220
Don't you understand how they feel?

00:20:55.620 --> 00:20:57.420
How could I know?

00:20:57.420 --> 00:20:59.800
Vanilla, you're my partner, right?

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:02.070
Can you not understand how I feel?

00:21:03.890 --> 00:21:08.130
Ichigo, you stubborn fool! I'm no longer your partner!

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:09.430
I don't care anymore.

00:21:12.430 --> 00:21:13.580
Vanilla...

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:18.280
Oh no... Why..?

